  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "How does the quote work?",
      "a": "Pick what you need, add a few words about your project and send the request. We review it and email you a quote within 24 hours, usually with a couple of questions so the price fits your project."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is the quote free?",
      "a": "Yes. The quote and any follow-up call are free and there is no obligation to go ahead."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer fixed prices?",
      "a": "Yes. Every project starts with a written scope and a fixed price. If the scope changes, we agree on the change and its price before doing the work."
    },
    {
      "q": "What affects the price of a project?",
      "a": "Mainly the number of features and user roles, the systems we need to connect to, how custom the design is and how soon you need to launch. We help you cut anything that is not needed for the first version."
    },
    {
      "q": "What if I am not sure which features I need?",
      "a": "Pick what seems closest and describe your goal in the message. We will suggest the simplest version that does the job in our reply."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you have partner rates for agencies?",
      "a": "Yes. Agencies get fixed partner rates for white-label work, so you can add your margin and price the project for your client."
    }
  ]
